OL,3,GNEWSAWhat is the Garvaghy Road dispute
OL,4,Aall about?
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor a few years in the 1990s, the
OL,7,FDrumcree parade dispute was one of the
OL,8,Fbiggest stories in Northern Ireland -
OL,9,Fand then, for 28 years, it fell out of
OL,10,Fthe public eye.
OL,12,FNow, almost three decades on, the
OL,13,Fparading row, which sparked some of the
OL,14,Fmost serious public disorder in
OL,15,FNorthern Ireland's history and was
OL,16,Flinked to several deaths, is back in
OL,17,Fthe headlines.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
