OL,3,GNEWSAWhat is the Garvaghy Road dispute
OL,4,Aall about?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt came after a court case in which a
OL,7,Fruling on Drumcree by the Parades
OL,8,FCommission - the organisation formed
OL,9,Fduring the Drumcree dispute to decide
OL,10,Fon contentious marches during Northern
OL,11,FIreland's parading season - was
OL,12,Foverturned.
OL,14,FNow the commission is under fire, while
OL,15,Fresidents and the Orange Order appear
OL,16,Fto be setting out their stall for a
OL,17,Frenewed fight over the future of the
OL,18,Fparade.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
